WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:01.166
ronda final

2
00:00:01.166 --> 00:00:03.166
del juicio de Silver Crown.

3
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.458
AERION STARFALL EL JOVEN HÉROE HONRADO DE ELARIA

4
00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:07.042
DUQUE KAEL HIGHVALE EL ORGULLOSO NOBLE RIVAL DE
AERION

5
00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:19.542
PRINCESA LYRA LA AMADA PRINCESA DE ELARIA

6
00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:19.625
Vamos, Aerión.

7
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:02.980
Aerion Lluvia de estrellas.

8
