18
00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:52.592
COLGANTE ESTRELLA

19
00:01:53.675 --> 00:01:55.950
COLGANTE LUNA

20
00:01:58.083 --> 00:02:00.159
Por la sagrada ley del Corazón de Cristal,

21
00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.359
